abstract: >-
  A proprietary, publicly inspectable research framework for reproducible
  simulation and evaluation of neuro-olfactive artificial intelligence,
  contextual olfactory memory, multimodal odor representation, corrective
  associative memory, graded out-of-distribution behavior, and deterministic
  policy conformance.
keywords:
